Third-party code vendored in this repository:

- src/ht.h — Hash Table in C by Alexey Kutepov (tsoding), dual-licensed
  MIT / Public Domain (Unlicense). See the license block at the end of the file.
- The murmur3 32-bit hash constants/algorithm used for path keys (public domain,
  Austin Appleby) are reimplemented in src/patchstore.c.
- The in-process diff/merge engine (src/diff.c) is original code by this
  project; no LGPL/GPL code is used or linked.
